WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,050
To put it bluntly, I don’t even remember what you look like.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:06,050
Have you finished talking? If you don’t like it, you just don’t like it.

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:09,050
Do you really not understand, or do you not want to understand?

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:12,050
From beginning to end, it was all your wishful thinking

5
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:16,050
An ordinary sentence was suddenly interpreted as affection by you

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:20,080
If you can't catch up, you should slander me for being good at saving Lanzu.

7
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,980
It's ridiculous

8
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,100
What about you? You are just a woman from a business background.

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,320
Her position is again

10
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:33,730
Compared with you, it doesn’t matter whether you say I have a scheming mind or not.

11
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:36,730
I never deny it, but what I seek is to work side by side

12
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:39,730
I have never thought of clinging to others

13
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:41,730
Put all your piety into others
